    "Id": "mechdef_hyaenodont_HYA-J",
    "Name": "Hyaenodont J",
    "Details": "The Hyaenodont J is a rare superheavy design equipped with two Booster Jets, rocket-assisted propulsion units powered by dedicated fusion cores, providing limited vertical lift and forward thrust capabilities uncommon among superheavies. These boosters partially offset the short maximum effective range of its two Rotary AP Large Bore Gauss Rifles, enabling improved maneuverability for close-range engagements. However, in large open areas, the mech’s high sensor signature makes it easily detected and avoided, limiting its ability to close with targets despite booster assistance. The loadout also includes two Enhanced Extended-Range Particle Projector Cannons with Particle Recycler Modules for sustained energy output. Target data sharing within the lance is managed via an integrated PHI Suite.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long +</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.28</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_Hyaenodont"
  },
